      "title": "CMake: Fix Qt -Werror compilation flag",
      "message": "CMake: Fix Qt -Werror compilation flag\n\nAll source files should have COMPILE_FLAGS applied, not just\nui/qt/*.cpp.\n\nThis fixes setting -Werror on the Qt build, since that is\nthe only custom C++ compilation flag we are using at the moment.\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "authored_date": "2022-10-04T14:05:45.000+01:00",
