      ],
      "title": "Qt: Fix deprecation of QByteArray::count()",
      "message": "Qt: Fix deprecation of QByteArray::count()\n\nUse size() instead, which is exactly the same as count(), and\nis not deprecated. Seems to exist in all out supported Qt\nversions, as far as I can tell.\n\nwarning: ‘qsizetype QByteArray::count() const’ is deprecated: Use size() or length() instead. [-Wdeprecated-declarations]\n  257 |     while ((int) (row_y + line_height_) < widget_height && offset < (int) data_.count()) {\n      |                                                                           ~~~~~~~~~~~^~\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "authored_date": "2022-10-04T13:33:37.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "committer_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2022-10-04T17:08:31.000+00:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/ec54b1c611792a20b12573a37cc26650412d5f1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "9acfcd1f9b0d023fedc6d963167a4de9d8f2f8ad",
      "short_id": "9acfcd1f",
      "created_at": "2022-10-04T17:08:31.000+00:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "f0a633622dcd5090a6d88d159ed5d6cc56ea5440"
      ],
      "title": "Qt: Fix setTextAlignment() deprecation",
      "message": "Qt: Fix setTextAlignment() deprecation\n\nCast away bogus deprecation created by deprecating\nsetTextAlignment(int, int) without fixing textAlignment()\nto not return int.\n\n```\nerror: ‘void QTreeWidgetItem::setTextAlignment(int, int)’ is deprecated: Use the overload taking Qt::Alignment [-Werror=deprecated-declarations]\n  597 |             wn_ti->setTextAlignment(col, ws_dlg->statsTreeWidget()->headerItem()->textAlignment(col));\n      |             ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n/usr/include/qt6/QtWidgets/qtreewidget.h:105:17: note: declared here\n  105 |     inline void setTextAlignment(int column, int alignment)\n      |                 ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n```\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "authored_date": "2022-10-04T13:22:41.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "committer_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2022-10-04T17:08:31.000+00:00",
